# Patterns are relative to the REPO ROOT: that is the build context.
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over <context>/.dockerignore, so
# this is the file it reads for the workspace image.
#
# The image copies two shell rc files and nothing else, so the context is cut
# down to just this directory. Everything the developer works on arrives at
# runtime through the bind mount, never through the build.

*
!.devcontainer
